      "category": null,
      "subheading": "The Company",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "Casey’s, with its principal business office, and Store Support Center, located at One SE Convenience Blvd., Ankeny, Iowa 50021-8045 (telephone 515-965-6100), was incorporated in Iowa in 1967.",
